      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "模式 B：Sharded Indexer (可选显存优化)\n\n• Indexer Cache 同样按 DCP 分片 → 各卡先选出本地候选 [T, 1, K_local]\n• 跨 DCP AllGather 候选 + Triton 稳定基数排序 (Radix Sort) 归并 Top-K",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "mode_b",
      "originalText": "模式 B：Sharded Indexer (可选显存优化)\n\n• Indexer Cache 同样按 DCP 分片 → 各卡先选出本地候选 [T, 1, K_local]\n• 跨 DCP AllGather 候选 + Triton 稳定基数排序 (Radix Sort) 归并 Top-K",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.28
    },
